[r]方才还裹在漆黑礼服里的学姐…
[np]

[mion storage="B_tokushu_M AB2_8_M"]
[playcv storage="mion_mion_00530_028.ogg" name="mion"]
[character name="mion"]
[FACEVIEW storage="mion_AB1_8_FACE_tokushu"]
【澪音】[r]「别、别这样…龙一…？」
[np]
[FACEHIDE]

[r]此刻正满脸通红地裹在极其普通的…充满少女气息的便服里！
[np]

[mion storage="D_tokushu_M CD2_4_M"]
[playcv storage="mion_mion_00530_029.ogg" name="mion"]
[character name="mion"]
[FACEVIEW storage="mion_CD1_4_FACE_tokushu"]
【澪音】[r]「别、别直勾勾盯着看啊…很羞耻的…」
